# MEOW-TOUCH(rebrand): test-suite artifacts. `test_sunshine` writes its log and
# `write_file_test_*.txt` fixtures into the CWD, so running the gate from the repo root
# leaves them untracked -- and `git add -A` then commits them. That happened once here:
# 30,331 insertions of test output, caught only by reading the diffstat.
test_sunmeow.log*
write_file_test_*.txt
